== (1) soundness and partition independence. 1:500 stop, tile DPR 2 (texel 6.62 cm, tile side S = 33.87 m); the
   reference view (7 x 5 positions). A terraced hill sunward of the view (the mountainous fixture's shape) and towers
   of 45, 30 and 20 m in rings 1-3; ground pixels on a 9 x 7 grid over the view, plus pixels along the hill's
   terminator; V by the law over the held structures against V over a world pyramid with no partition.
   hill 300 m, sun 15 deg at azimuth 0: 84 pixels, 36 in shadow; cells resolved 38, of them in blocks 38 (orders [4], levels up to 7); cells outside their structure's levels 0; pixels whose V differs from the unpartitioned law 0
   hill 300 m, sun 15 deg at azimuth 45: 84 pixels, 36 in shadow; cells resolved 47, of them in blocks 46 (orders [4], levels up to 7); cells outside their structure's levels 0; pixels whose V differs from the unpartitioned law 0
   hill 1000 m, sun 15 deg at azimuth 0: 84 pixels, 46 in shadow; cells resolved 59, of them in blocks 59 (orders [6], levels up to 8); cells outside their structure's levels 0; pixels whose V differs from the unpartitioned law 0
   hill 1000 m, sun 15 deg at azimuth 45: 84 pixels, 64 in shadow; cells resolved 70, of them in blocks 69 (orders [5], levels up to 8); cells outside their structure's levels 0; pixels whose V differs from the unpartitioned law 0
   hill 3000 m, sun 15 deg at azimuth 0: 84 pixels, 58 in shadow; cells resolved 84, of them in blocks 84 (orders [8], levels up to 10); cells outside their structure's levels 0; pixels whose V differs from the unpartitioned law 0
   hill 3000 m, sun 15 deg at azimuth 45: 84 pixels, 84 in shadow; cells resolved 84, of them in blocks 83 (orders [7], levels up to 10); cells outside their structure's levels 0; pixels whose V differs from the unpartitioned law 0
   hill 3000 m, sun 7 deg at azimuth 0: 84 pixels, 69 in shadow; cells resolved 84, of them in blocks 84 (orders [0, 9], levels up to 11); cells outside their structure's levels 0; pixels whose V differs from the unpartitioned law 0
   hill 3000 m, sun 7 deg at azimuth 45: 84 pixels, 84 in shadow; cells resolved 84, of them in blocks 83 (orders [8], levels up to 11); cells outside their structure's levels 0; pixels whose V differs from the unpartitioned law 0
   total: 0 differing pixels or out-of-level cells (0 = the partition changes no value)
