== (4) the alternatives, at the 1:500 stop
   (a) the r2 text: every ring position held out to R (the verifier's rings receipt reproduces it: 5 440 positions for
       300 m of relief under a 15 deg sun at DPR 2, 53 788 for 1 000 m).
   (b) positions held one by one out to ring j0 = 16, reference view at DPR 2: 1408 positions, each a raster job and
       a transfer (the held set of (2) instead: see its "held" column),
       and a whole-frame far field from level 6 (4.23 m cells) over TOWN (2.0 km + 30 % margins):   0.57 M cells,   0.73 MB at 1 B,   1.45 MB at 2 B
       and a whole-frame far field from level 6 (4.23 m cells) over CITY (5.0 km + margins):   3.57 M cells,   4.54 MB at 1 B,   9.08 MB at 2 B
       and a whole-frame far field from level 6 (4.23 m cells) over METROPOLIS target (8.0 km + margins):   9.14 M cells,  11.63 MB at 1 B,  23.26 MB at 2 B
