       and a whole-frame far field from level 6 (2.82 m cells) over TOWN (2.0 km + 30 % margins):   1.29 M cells,   1.64 MB at 1 B,   3.27 MB at 2 B
       and a whole-frame far field from level 6 (2.82 m cells) over CITY (5.0 km + margins):   8.04 M cells,  10.22 MB at 1 B,  20.44 MB at 2 B
       and a whole-frame far field from level 6 (2.82 m cells) over METROPOLIS target (8.0 km + margins):  20.58 M cells,  26.16 MB at 1 B,  52.33 MB at 2 B
       and a whole-frame far field from level 6 (2.82 m cells) over the cap, square (12.4 km + margins):  49.42 M cells,  62.84 MB at 1 B, 125.68 MB at 2 B
       and a whole-frame far field from level 6 (2.82 m cells) over the cap, aspect 2 (17.53 x 8.76 km + margins):  49.35 M cells,  62.75 MB at 1 B, 125.51 MB at 2 B
   (c) a cap on R at N tile sides: a caster beyond N·S never shades the view, while the same caster shades it at a
       coarser stop whose tiles are larger, so a shadow's presence would change with the zoom stop (J-A68.84).
