== (6) the build-time model of the blocks over a whole frame at the finest stop (PLAUSIBLE until M2b): each block
   reads the city band's marks that meet it (each mark of the frame met by the blocks of one partition about once:
   ~1 us each), the terrain field's samples meeting it (~2 ns each) and writes its 21 845 cells (~0.05 ms per block);
   marks ~11.5 per building (§8.1 item 6: ~60 000 marks for ~5 200 buildings); terrain cells 5 / 8 / 10 m (§2.3).
   TOWN target       : ~   15525 marks, ~0.41 M samples, <= 450 blocks (2): ~  38.8 ms
   CITY target       : ~   60375 marks, ~1.00 M samples, <= 450 blocks (2): ~  84.9 ms
   METROPOLIS target : ~  155250 marks, ~1.64 M samples, <= 450 blocks (2): ~ 181.0 ms
   the cap           : ~  402500 marks, ~3.94 M samples, <= 450 blocks (2): ~ 432.9 ms
